('RV-0-250-575655','P423148','SEED_CATALOG','RV-0-250-575655','5',1,NULL,NULL,'I loved this product it removes your old makeup effortlessly with hardly any scrubbing. It also leaves your face feeling super clean and super soft.','이 제품 정말 마음에 들어요. 남아 있는 메이크업도 거의 문지르지 않고 깔끔하게 지워줘요. 사용 후에는 얼굴이 정말 깨끗하고 부드럽게 느껴져요.','combination','light','brown','hazel'),
('RV-0-250-576885','P423148','SEED_CATALOG','RV-0-250-576885','5',1,NULL,NULL,'I loved this product it removes your old makeup effortlessly with hardly any scrubbing. It also leaves your face feeling super clean and super soft.','이 제품 정말 마음에 들어요. 남아 있는 메이크업도 거의 문지르지 않고 깔끔하게 지워줘요. 사용 후에는 얼굴이 정말 깨끗하고 부드럽게 느껴져요.','combination','light','brown','hazel'),
('RV-0-250-575908','P423148','SEED_CATALOG','RV-0-250-575908','5',1,'love this!!','너무 좋아요!!','I have used many cleansing oils and I have almost always had an issue with eye irritation. (For reference, I have blue eyes that are pretty sensitive and also sensitive to light.) The first time I had this applied to my skin was by a skin therapist who used it as step one in a double cleanse to remove my makeup before applying other products. I was so pleasantly surprised by the way it left my skin feeling and absolutely shocked that my eyes were completely unbothered. it removed every trace of makeup and left my skin not only feeling clean, but also comfortable and almost hydrated. I noticed the second cleanser felt even better after this precleanse and every other step after was fantastic. I definitely recommend this to anyone for makeup/sunscreen removal and cleansing in general.','여러 클렌징 오일을 써봤는데 눈 자극이 거의 항상 있었어요. (참고로 저는 푸른 눈에 민감하고 빛에도 예민해요.) 이 제품을 처음 피부에 사용한 건 피부 테라피스트가 더블 클렌징 첫 단계로 메이크업 제거용으로 썼을 때였는데, 세안 후 피부 느낌에 완전 놀랐고 눈이 전혀 자극받지 않은 게 충격적이었어요. 메이크업 잔여물 없이 완벽하게 지워주고 피부가 깨끗할 뿐 아니라 편안하고 거의 촉촉한 느낌이었어요. 이 제품 사용 후 두 번째 클렌저가 더 좋게 느껴졌고 그 다음 단계들도 모두 만족스러웠어요. 메이크업이나 자외선 차단제 제거, 일반 세안용으로 정말 추천해요.','combination','light','blonde','blue'),
('RV-0-250-577138','P423148','SEED_CATALOG','RV-0-250-577138','5',1,'love this!!','이거 진짜 좋아요!!','I have used many cleansing oils and I have almost always had an issue with eye irritation. (For reference, I have blue eyes that are pretty sensitive and also sensitive to light.) The first time I had this applied to my skin was by a skin therapist who used it as step one in a double cleanse to remove my makeup before applying other products. I was so pleasantly surprised by the way it left my skin feeling and absolutely shocked that my eyes were completely unbothered. it removed every trace of makeup and left my skin not only feeling clean, but also comfortable and almost hydrated. I noticed the second cleanser felt even better after this precleanse and every other step after was fantastic. I definitely recommend this to anyone for makeup/sunscreen removal and cleansing in general.','저는 클렌징 오일을 여러 번 써봤는데 거의 항상 눈이 자극받았어요. (참고로 저는 파란 눈에 꽤 민감하고 빛에도 예민해요.) 처음 이 제품을 피부에 사용한 건 피부 관리사분이 더블 클렌징 첫 단계로 메이크업을 지우기 위해 사용했을 때였는데, 세안 후 피부 느낌에 너무 놀랐고 눈이 전혀 불편하지 않아서 완전 충격이었어요. 메이크업 잔여물이 완벽하게 지워졌고 피부가 깨끗할 뿐 아니라 편안하고 거의 촉촉한 느낌이었어요. 이 프리클렌징 후에 두 번째 클렌저가 더 좋게 느껴졌고 이후 모든 단계가 환상적이었어요. 메이크업/선크림 제거와 클렌징 전반에 이 제품을 정말 추천해요.','combination','light','blonde','blue'),
('RV-0-250-580271','P474953','SEED_CATALOG','RV-0-250-580271','4',1,'Nice oil but not for combo skin in summer','좋은 오일인데 여름 복합성 피부에는 안 맞아요','I so wanted to love this face oil! Smells great and made my face luminous and radiant for the first week. Unfortunately, by week two I had major breakouts which I haven’t had in years. I have combo skin and it gets oily in summer. I’ll try again in winter to see if it works better!','이 페이스 오일을 정말 좋아하고 싶었어요! 향도 좋고 첫 주에는 얼굴이 빛나고 환해졌거든요. 그런데 2주 차부터 몇 년 만에 큰 트러블이 났어요. 저는 복합성 피부고 여름에는 유분이 많아져요. 겨울에 다시 써보고 더 잘 맞는지 확인해보려 해요!','combination','light','brown','brown'),
('RV-0-250-581506','P474953','SEED_CATALOG','RV-0-250-581506','4',1,'Nice oil but not for combo skin in summer','좋은 오일인데 여름 복합성 피부에는 안 맞아요','I so wanted to love this face oil! Smells great and made my face luminous and radiant for the first week. Unfortunately, by week two I had major breakouts which I haven’t had in years. I have combo skin and it gets oily in summer. I’ll try again in winter to see if it works better!','이 페이스 오일을 정말 좋아하고 싶었어요! 향도 좋고 첫 주에는 얼굴이 빛나고 환해졌거든요. 그런데 2주 차부터 몇 년 만에 큰 트러블이 났어요. 저는 복합성 피부고 여름에는 유분이 많아져요. 겨울에 다시 써보고 더 잘 맞는지 확인해보려 해요!','combination','light','brown','brown'),
('RV-0-250-579804','P474953','SEED_CATALOG','RV-0-250-579804','4',1,NULL,NULL,'At first, the smell was a bit overwhelming and strong, but after the first few uses I grew to love the smell! Although it is an oil, it did not make my skin feel oily at all. It wore really well under my makeup. It made my skin feel really soft and it did have a plumping effect! I love what it did for my skin and my skin looks rejuvenated. It took about a week or so of using it as directed to see the full effects. I found that it applies better if dropped directly into the face opposed to placing it in your hand and then on your face.  I definitely recommend this skin product and feel that it does what it is intended to do.','처음에는 향이 좀 강하고 부담스러웠는데 몇 번 쓰고 나니 향이 좋아졌어요! 오일인데도 피부가 전혀 번들거리지 않았고 메이크업 위에 발라도 잘 밀착됐어요. 피부가 정말 부드러워졌고 볼륨감도 느껴졌어요! 피부에 생기가 도는 느낌이에요. 지침대로 약 일주일 정도 사용하니 효과가 확실히 나타났어요. 손에 덜지 말고 얼굴에 바로 떨어뜨려 바르면 더 잘 발려요. 이 제품 정말 추천드리고, 기대한 만큼 효과가 있다고 생각해요.','combination','light','blonde','brown'),
('RV-0-250-581039','P474953','SEED_CATALOG','RV-0-250-581039','4',1,NULL,NULL,'At first, the smell was a bit overwhelming and strong, but after the first few uses I grew to love the smell! Although it is an oil, it did not make my skin feel oily at all. It wore really well under my makeup. It made my skin feel really soft and it did have a plumping effect! I love what it did for my skin and my skin looks rejuvenated. It took about a week or so of using it as directed to see the full effects. I found that it applies better if dropped directly into the face opposed to placing it in your hand and then on your face.  I definitely recommend this skin product and feel that it does what it is intended to do.','처음에는 향이 좀 강하고 부담스러웠는데 몇 번 쓰고 나니 향이 좋아졌어요! 오일인데도 피부가 전혀 번들거리지 않았고 메이크업 위에 발라도 잘 밀착됐어요. 피부가 정말 부드러워졌고 볼륨감도 느껴졌어요! 피부에 생기가 도는 느낌이에요. 지침대로 약 일주일 정도 사용하니 효과가 확실히 나타났어요. 손에 덜지 말고 얼굴에 바로 떨어뜨려 바르면 더 잘 발려요. 이 제품 정말 추천드리고, 기대한 만큼 효과가 있다고 생각해요.','combination','light','blonde','brown'),
('RV-0-250-580495','P474953','SEED_CATALOG','RV-0-250-580495','4',1,NULL,NULL,'Guerlain Abeille Royale Watery Oil is very lovely and indulgent. It has a wonderful scent. The fragrance doesn’t bother me, but it IS scented. It is one of the lightest facial oils I’ve ever used. It is nice to use at night, but does well under makeup too.','Guerlain Abeille Royale Watery Oil은 정말 사랑스럽고 고급스러워요. 향도 정말 좋아요. 향이 거슬리진 않지만, 향이 있는 제품이에요. 제가 써본 페이셜 오일 중 가장 가벼운 편이에요. 밤에 쓰기 좋고, 메이크업 전에 발라도 잘 맞아요.','combination','light','blonde','hazel'),
('RV-0-250-581730','P474953','SEED_CATALOG','RV-0-250-581730','4',1,NULL,NULL,'Guerlain Abeille Royale Watery Oil is very lovely and indulgent. It has a wonderful scent. The fragrance doesn’t bother me, but it IS scented. It is one of the lightest facial oils I’ve ever used. It is nice to use at night, but does well under makeup too.','Guerlain Abeille Royale Watery Oil은 정말 사랑스럽고 고급스러워요. 향도 정말 좋아요. 향이 거슬리진 않지만, 향이 있는 제품이에요. 제가 써본 페이셜 오일 중 가장 가벼운 편이에요. 밤에 쓰기 좋고, 메이크업 전에 발라도 잘 맞아요.','combination','light','blonde','hazel'),
('RV-0-250-579973','P474953','SEED_CATALOG','RV-0-250-579973','3',0,'High in fragrance but beautiful packaging!','향이 강하지만 포장 예뻐요!','The product in terms of packaging and the way it looks is amazing, it feels like a high quality product. However the product did not work for me personally. It is very high in fragrance and almost instantly gave me a rash and broke me out. It’s probably because my skin is sensitive. However, my mom tried it and she loves it! She felt hydrated and plumed. So it’s definitely not a product for everyone, especially if you’re sensitive to fragrance.','패키지와 디자인은 정말 멋지고 고급스러운 제품 같아요. 다만 저한테는 효과가 없었어요. 향이 너무 강해서 거의 바로 발진이 나고 트러블이 생겼어요. 아마 제 피부가 민감해서 그런 것 같아요. 그런데 엄마가 써보시더니 너무 좋아하시더라고요! 촉촉하고 탱탱해졌대요. 그래서 모든 분께 맞는 제품은 아니에요, 특히 향에 민감하신 분들은 조심하셔야 해요.','combination','light','brown','brown'),
('RV-0-250-581208','P474953','SEED_CATALOG','RV-0-250-581208','3',0,'High in fragrance but beautiful packaging!','향이 강하지만 포장 예뻐요!','The product in terms of packaging and the way it looks is amazing, it feels like a high quality product. However the product did not work for me personally. It is very high in fragrance and almost instantly gave me a rash and broke me out. It’s probably because my skin is sensitive. However, my mom tried it and she loves it! She felt hydrated and plumed. So it’s definitely not a product for everyone, especially if you’re sensitive to fragrance.','패키지와 디자인은 정말 멋지고 고급스러운 제품 같아요. 다만 저한테는 효과가 없었어요. 향이 너무 강해서 거의 바로 발진이 나고 트러블이 생겼어요. 아마 제 피부가 민감해서 그런 것 같아요. 그런데 엄마가 써보시더니 너무 좋아하시더라고요! 촉촉하고 탱탱해졌대요. 그래서 모든 분께 맞는 제품은 아니에요, 특히 향에 민감하신 분들은 조심하셔야 해요.','combination','light','brown','brown'),
('RV-0-250-580378','P474953','SEED_CATALOG','RV-0-250-580378','5',1,'Smooth results','부드러운 효과','Abeille Royale Advanced Youth Watery Oil is a great addition to my skin care routine. I was really impressed how smooth and soft it made skin. I can also see a difference in my fine lines. I really like the way it feels in my skin. It’s not heavy or sticky feeling. I have to say I really enjoy the scent. Really only noticed the scent while applying. The overall results of how healthy my skin looks has me hooked. It has become an essential part of my skin care routine. I received Abeille Royale Advanced Youth Watery Oil as a free product from Influenster. I would highly recommend it.','Abeille Royale Advanced Youth Watery Oil은 제 스킨케어 루틴에 정말 좋은 추가 제품이에요. 피부가 얼마나 부드럽고 매끄러워지는지 정말 감탄했어요. 잔주름도 확실히 달라진 게 보여요. 피부에 닿는 느낌도 정말 좋아요. 무겁거나 끈적이지 않아요. 향도 정말 좋아서 바를 때만 살짝 느껴져요. 피부가 건강해 보이는 전반적인 효과에 완전히 반했어요. 이제 제 스킨케어 필수품이 되었답니다. Influenster에서 무료로 받아 사용해봤는데, 강력히 추천해요.','combination','light','auburn','brown'),
('RV-0-250-581613','P474953','SEED_CATALOG','RV-0-250-581613','5',1,'Smooth results','부드러운 효과','Abeille Royale Advanced Youth Watery Oil is a great addition to my skin care routine. I was really impressed how smooth and soft it made skin. I can also see a difference in my fine lines. I really like the way it feels in my skin. It’s not heavy or sticky feeling. I have to say I really enjoy the scent. Really only noticed the scent while applying. The overall results of how healthy my skin looks has me hooked. It has become an essential part of my skin care routine. I received Abeille Royale Advanced Youth Watery Oil as a free product from Influenster. I would highly recommend it.','Abeille Royale Advanced Youth Watery Oil은 제 스킨케어 루틴에 정말 좋은 추가 제품이에요. 피부가 얼마나 부드럽고 매끄러워지는지 정말 감탄했어요. 잔주름도 확실히 달라진 게 보여요. 피부에 닿는 느낌도 정말 좋아요. 무겁거나 끈적이지 않아서 좋고, 향도 정말 마음에 들어요. 바를 때만 살짝 느껴지는 향이에요. 피부가 건강해 보이는 전체적인 결과에 완전히 반했어요. 이제는 제 스킨케어 루틴의 필수품이 되었답니다. Influenster에서 무료로 받아 사용해봤는데, 강력히 추천드려요.','combination','light','auburn','brown'),
('RV-0-250-585006','P456208','SEED_CATALOG','RV-0-250-585006','2',0,'Too Harsh for Sensitive or Dry Skin','민감하거나 건성 피부에는 너무 강해요','I received this product as a free sample to review. I had a feeling when I received it that this product would not be a good fit for me, and I was right. I have incredibly dry skin that is very sensitive. I followed the instructions for the product and started to feel tingling immediately. I know that the product is a chemical peel strength and I could only leave it on for about 5 minutes before I was incredibly uncomfortable. I would air with caution if you have sensitive or dry skin.','이 제품을 무료 샘플로 받아서 사용해봤어요. 받자마자 이 제품이 제게 맞지 않을 거라는 느낌이 들었는데, 역시 그랬어요. 저는 정말 건조하고 민감한 피부를 가지고 있어요. 제품 설명대로 써봤는데 바로 따끔거리는 느낌이 들었어요. 이 제품이 화학적 필링 강도라는 걸 알고 있어서 5분 정도만 바르고 견딜 수 있었어요. 민감하거나 건성 피부라면 조심해서 사용하시는 게 좋을 것 같아요.','dry','light','brown','brown'),
('RV-0-250-586202','P456208','SEED_CATALOG','RV-0-250-586202','2',0,'Too Harsh for Sensitive or Dry Skin',NULL,'I received this product as a free sample to review. I had a feeling when I received it that this product would not be a good fit for me, and I was right. I have incredibly dry skin that is very sensitive. I followed the instructions for the product and started to feel tingling immediately. I know that the product is a chemical peel strength and I could only leave it on for about 5 minutes before I was incredibly uncomfortable. I would air with caution if you have sensitive or dry skin.',NULL,'dry','light','brown','brown'),
('RV-0-250-584681','P456208','SEED_CATALOG','RV-0-250-584681','4',1,NULL,NULL,'Este producto me ha gustado bastante! Es super suave y huele muy bien. Y es excelente, usenlo en la noche y verán resultados.','이 제품 정말 마음에 들어요! 아주 부드럽고 향도 좋아요. 밤에 쓰면 효과가 확실히 보여요.','normal','medium','brown','brown'),
