('RV-0-250-593128','P421998','SEED_CATALOG','RV-0-250-593128','3',0,NULL,NULL,'Honestly haven’t seen great results from this. Disappointed.','솔직히 큰 효과는 못 봤어요. 좀 실망스러웠어요.','combination','light','blonde','blue'),
