 더 매끄럽다고 응답.- 90%가 눈가가 더 탄탄하고 젊어 보인다고 응답.- 92%가 눈가가 더 밝아졌다고 응답.\\n150명과 151명의 여성 대상 4주 소비자 조사 결과:- 85%가 눈가 잔주름이 줄어든 것을 확인.- 86%가 눈 밑 잔주름이 줄어든 것을 확인.\\n32명의 여성 대상 12주 소비자 조사 결과:- 100%가 눈가가 더 매끄럽다고 응답.\\n48명의 여성 대상 12주 소비자 조사 결과:- 20%가 눈 밑 부기 감소를 경험."}','[]',NULL,'https://www.sephora.com/productimages/sku/s2531697-main-zoom.jpg','{"what_it_is":"An anti-aging eye cream that helps strengthen delicate under-eye skin, smooth the look of wrinkles, brighten the eye area, and visibly reduce puffiness.\\nSkin Type: Normal, Dry, Combination, and Oily","concerns_text":"Fine Lines and Wrinkles, Dark Circles, Puffiness","highlighted_ingredients":["CL1870 Peptide Complex™: Fights the look of wrinkles by boosting natural collagen.- Sigesbeckia orientalis extract: Helps skin maintain its density.- Hyaluronic acid: Helps restore suppleness and visibly smooth fine, dry lines."],"ingredient_callouts":"Free of parabens and phthalates, contains less than one percent synthetic fragrance, and comes in recyclable packaging.","what_else":"This anti-aging eye cream for wrinkles helps strengthen and hydrate delicate under-eye skin to visibly smooth fine lines, brighten dark circles, and reduce crepiness. Designed to improve the tear trough area, its lightweight, fast-absorbing formula delivers lasting moisture for a refreshed, youthful look.","clinical_results":"After a 1-week consumer study with 156 women:- 94% agree eye area looks smoother.- 90% agree eye are feels firmer and looks younger.- 92% agree eye area looks brighter.\\nAfter a 4-week consumer study with 150 women and 151 women, respectively:- 85% agree this product reduced the appearance of crow’s feet.- 86% agree this product reduced the appearance of undereye lines.\\nAfter a 12-week consumer study with 32 women:- 100% agree the eye area feels smoother.\\nAfter a 12-week consumer study with 48 women:- 20% saw a reduction in the appearance of under-eye puffiness.","suggested_usage":"-Apply around eye area, gently massaging into skin.-Use twice a day, morning and evening.","brand_story":"Maximum Results | Allergy-tested, 100 percent fragrance-free, and always formulated for maximum results—without irritation. Clinique avoids using allergens, irritants, and ingredients that can age or harm skin, while never sacrificing one bit of the effectiveness you need."}','Water/Aqua/Eau, Tridecyl Trimellitate, Glycerin, Neopentyl Glycol Diethylhexanoate, Polyglyceryl-6 Distearate, Glyceryl Behenate, Mangifera Indica (Mango) Seed Butter, Propanediol, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Cetearyl Wheat Straw Glycosides, Hypnea Musciformis (Algae) Extract, Gelidiella Acerosa Extract, Polygonum Cuspidatum Root Extract, Laminaria Digitata Extract, Saccharomyces Lysate Extract, Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract, Sigesbeckia Orientalis (St. Paul Wort) Extract, Whey Protein/Lactis Protein/Protéine Du Petit-Lait, Prunus Amygdalus Dulcis (Sweet Almond) Seed Extract, Acetyl Hexapeptide-8, Acetyl Octapeptide-3, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1, Palmitoyl Tetrapeptide-7, Palmitoyl Hexapeptide-12, Phytosteryl/Isostearyl/Cetyl/Stearyl/Behenyl Dimer Dilinoleate, Lactobacillus Ferment, Sodium Hyaluronate, Tocopheryl Acetate, Butylene Glycol, Cetearyl Alcohol, Caffeine, Tetrahexyldecyl Ascorbate, Sucrose, Acetyl Glucosamine, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Arachidyl Glucoside, Jojoba Esters, Tridecyl Stearate, Dipentaerythrityl Hexacaprylate/Hexacaprate, Molasses Extract/Saccharum Officinarum/Extrait De Mélasse, Trehalose, Ethylhexylglycerin, Cholesterol, Bisabolol, Peg-8, Beeswax/Cera Alba/Cire d’abeille, Glyceryl Acrylate/Acrylic Acid Copolymer, Glycine Soja (Soybean) Seed Extract, Caprylyl Glycol, Tocopherol, Nylon-12, Potassium Cetyl Phosphate, Glyceryl Polymethacrylate, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Ammonium Acryloyldimethyltaurate/Vp Copolymer, Arachidyl Alcohol, Cetyl Alcohol, Polyglyceryl-3 Beeswax, Behenyl Alcohol, Glyceryl Stearate, Stearic Acid, Carbomer, Polysorbate 20, Sodium Hydroxide, Bht, Disodium Edta, Sodium Citrate, Potassium Sorbate, Sodium Benzoate, Phenoxyethanol <ILN49540>.','57.0','4.24','2017','3109','102','observed'),
('P417936','4348','Cleansers','Rose & Hyaluronic Acid Deep Hydration Toner','seed_catalog','ACTIVE','Cleansers','Toners','35-50','로즈 & 히알루론산 딥 하이드레이션 토너','250ml','정제수, 글리세린, 부틸렌글라이콜, 로사 센티폴리아 꽃, 로사 다마세나 꽃수, 로사 멀티플로라 열매 추출물, 당귀잎 추출물, 로사 다마세나 꽃 오일, 소듐하이알루로네이트, PEG-150, PPG-26-부테스-26, PEG-40 수소첨가 피마자유, 소듐 시트레이트, 잔탄검, 구연산, BHT, 향료, 페녹시에탄올, 시트로넬롤, 제라니올.','{"what_it_is":"알코올 프리 클렌징 토너로, 진짜 장미 꽃잎이 함유되어 남아있는 불순물을 제거하고 모공을 정돈하며 피부를 부드럽게 만들어 건강한 피부결을 완성합니다.","suggested_usage":"- 세안 후, 화장솜이나 손끝을 이용해 얼굴과 목에 부드럽게 닦아내세요.\\n- 아침과 저녁 하루 두 번 사용할 수 있습니다.","what_else":"이 제품은 OK! 매거진 2017 봄 뷰티 어워드 수상작입니다.\\n\\n\\"이 토너를 사랑하는 이유를 꼽자면: 신비로운 장미 향, 떠다니는 꽃잎, 그리고 무엇보다도 피부를 자극 없이 깊게 클렌징하는 능력입니다.\\" — OK! 매거진\\n\\n\\"진짜 장미 꽃잎이 함유된 로즈 딥 하이드레이션 페이셜 토너는 피부와 감각 모두에게 천상의 경험을 선사합니다. 이 부드럽고 상쾌한 토너는 모공을 정돈하는 장미 열매 추출물, 진정 효과가 있는 장미수, 영양을 공급하는 장미 꽃 오일, 수분을 유지하는 당귀잎 추출물과 히알루론산을 함유하고 있습니다. 그 결과 건강하고 깊은 보습감과 벨벳처럼 부드러운 피부결을 느낄 수 있습니다.\\" — 레브 글라즈만, Fresh 공동 창립자\\n\\n이 제품은 얼루어 베스트 오브 뷰티 어워드 수상작입니다.","concerns_text":null,"highlighted_ingredients":[],"skin_type":null,"ingredient_callouts":null,"brand_story":"고대의 뷰티 의식과 현대 기술을 접목한 Fresh는 독특하면서도 효과적인 제품을 선보입니다. 최고급 원료만을 아낌없이 사용하여 메이크업, 스킨케어, 헤어, 바스 & 바디 제품뿐 아니라 특별한 향수까지 고품질의 컬렉션을 만듭니다.","clinical_results":"인체 적용 시험 결과:\\n\\n\\n- 100%가 오염 입자와 잔여 불순물 제거에 도움이 되었다고 응답\\n\\n\\n- 97%가 피부가 부드럽고 상쾌해졌다고 느낌\\n\\n\\n- 94%가 피부가 매끄러워졌다고 보고\\n\\n\\n- 90%가 진정 효과를 느꼈다고 응답\\n\\n\\n- 46%가 사용 후 6시간 동안 수분감이 증가했다고 느낌"}','[]','특가','https://www.sephora.com/productimages/sku/s1924901-main-zoom.jpg','{"what_it_is":"An alcohol-free cleansing toner infused with real rose petals to remove residual impurities, refine the appearance of pores, and soften skin for a healthy-looking complexion.","what_else":"This product is an OK! Magazine 2017 Spring Beauty Award winner.\\n\\n&quot;Let us count the ways we love this toner: the divine rose scent, the floating petals and, most of all, its ability to deep-clean skin without stripping it.&quot;&#151;OK! Magazine\\r\\n&quot;Infused with real rose petals, Rose Deep Hydration Facial Toner is a heavenly experience for your skin and your senses. This gentle, refreshing toner contains pore-refining rose fruit extract, soothing rosewater, and nourishing rose flower oil, as well as moisture-retaining angelica leaf extract and hyaluronic acid. The result is a healthy, deeply hydrated, and velvety soft complexion.&quot;&#151;Lev Glazman, Fresh Co-founder\\r\\n\\nThis product is an Allure Best of Beauty award winner.","clinical_results":"In an in-vivo test:\\r\\n\\n- 100% said it helped clear pollution particles and residual impurities\\r\\n\\n- 97% felt it softened and refreshed their skin\\r\\n\\n- 94% reported it left their skin smooth\\r\\n\\n- 90% felt it was soothing\\r\\n\\n- 46% increased hydration for 6 hours after application","suggested_usage":"-After cleansing, gently sweep over the face and neck with a cotton pad or fingertips.\\n-Can be used twice a day, morning and night.","brand_story":"Mixing ancient beauty rituals with modern technology, Fresh offers one-of-a-kind products that perform and pamper. They splurge on everything, and skimp on nothing, to create a collection of high quality—and highly effective—makeup, skin, hair, bath and body products, as well as extraordinary fragrances."}','Water, Glycerin, Butylene Glycol, Rosa Centifolia Flower, Rosa Damascena Flower Water, Rosa Multiflora Fruit Extract, Angelica Keiskei Extract, Rosa Damascena Flower Oil, Sodium Hyaluronate, PEG-150, PPG-26-Buteth-26, PEG-40 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Sodium Citrate, Xanthan Gum, Citric Acid, BHT, Parfum (Fragrance), Phenoxyethanol, Citronellol, Geraniol.','46.0','4.16','1351','159149','103','observed'),
