n- 100%가 눈가가 깊게 촉촉해졌다고 동의\\n\\n\\n- 100%가 피부가 진정되고 회복되었다고 동의\\n\\n\\n- 97%가 눈가가 생기 있어 보인다고 동의\\n\\n\\n- 97%가 피부가 영양을 받은 느낌이라고 동의\\n\\n\\n- 90%가 피부가 더 탄탄해졌다고 동의\\n\\n\\n- 90%가 피부가 회복된 느낌이라고 동의\\n\\n\\n- 84%가 눈가가 더 밝아 보인다고 동의"}','[]',NULL,'https://www.sephora.com/productimages/sku/s2062081-main-zoom.jpg','{"what_it_is":"A rich and restorative eye cream featuring a brightening combination of eight peptides, five forms of vitamin C, and cucumber extract for firmer, stronger-looking skin around the eye area.","what_else":"This product is free of gluten, fragrance, essential oil, silicone, and irritants. It is vegan and cruelty-free.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\nDrunk Elephant uses clean ingredients that either directly benefit the skin''s health or support the integrity and effectiveness of our formulations. They never take into account an ingredient''s synthetic or natural status, but instead choose based on its safety and bio-compatibility. You won''t find silicones, chemical sunscreens, sensitizing dyes, perfumes, or fragrant essential oils of any kind in any of their products, making them appropriate for every skin type. Drunk Elephant is a supporter of IEF (International Elephant Foundation) and is cruelty-free.","clinical_results":"In an independent consumer testing panel of 50 women ages 25 to 55:\\r\\n\\n- 100% agree their eye area felt deeply hydrated\\r\\n\\n- 100% agree their skin felt soothed and replenished\\r\\n\\n- 97% agree their eye area looked refreshed\\r\\n\\n- 97% agree their skin felt nourished\\r\\n\\n- 90% agree their skin felt firmer\\r\\n\\n- 90% agree their skin felt restored\\r\\n\\n- 84% agree their eye area looked brighter","suggested_usage":"-Gently pat a pump of C-Tango&trade; around the eye area using your ring finger.\\n-May be mixed with Shaba Complex&trade; Eye Serum. \\r\\n\\n-Tip: leave in the fridge for a cooling, soothing treatment."}','Water, Glycerin, Dicaprylyl Carbonate, Cetearyl Alcohol, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Hydroxyethyl Acrylate/Sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer, Sodium Ascorbyl Phosphate, Cetearyl Olivate, Sorbitan Olivate, Sclerocarya Birrea Seed Oil, Persea Gratissima (Avocado) Oil, Plukenetia Volubilis Seed Oil, Magnesium Ascorbyl Phosphate, Ceteareth-6 Olivate, Tetrahexyldecyl Ascorbate, Ascorbyl Glucoside, Ascorbyl Palmitate, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1, Glycine Soja (Soybean) Sterols, Linoleic Acid, Phospholipids, Ceramide NP, Glycine Soja (Soybean) Protein, Ceramide AP, Phytosphingosine, Cholesterol, Ceramide EOP, Cucumis Sativus (Cucumber) Fruit Extract, Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract, Palmitoyl Dipeptide-5 Diaminobutyroyl Hydroxythreonine, Palmitoyl Dipeptide-5 Diaminohydroxybutyrate, Dipeptide Diaminobutyroyl Benzylamide Diacetate, Sodium Hyaluronate Crosspolymer, C12-15 Alkyl Benzoate, Panthenol, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Hesperidin Methyl Chalcone, Dipeptide-2, Palmitoyl Tetrapeptide-7, Fragaria Ananassa (Strawberry) Seed Extract, Medicago Sativa (Alfalfa) Extract, Morus Alba Leaf Extract, Hydrolyzed Rice Protein, Spilanthes Acmella Flower Extract, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice, Ubiquinone, Superoxide Dismutase, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-38, Acetyl Hexapeptide-8, Pyrus Malus (Apple) Fruit Extract, Phytic Acid, Actinidia Chinensis (Kiwi) Fruit Extract, Vaccinium Myrtillus Leaf Extract, Tocopherol, Thioctic Acid, N-Hydroxysuccinimide, Chrysin, Mica, Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Phenoxyethanol, Pentylene Glycol, Sodium Lauroyl Lactylate, Titanium Dioxide, Hydroxypropyl Cyclodextrin, Sodium Benzoate, Xanthan Gum, Carbomer, Tocopheryl Acetate, Sodium Dextran Sulfate, Sorbitan Isostearate, Caprylyl Glycol, Steareth-20, Chlorhexidine Digluconate, Citric Acid, Chlorphenesin, Polysorbate 60, Potassium Sorbate, Ethylhexylglycerin.','64.0','3.75','1484','124160','104','observed'),
('P399623','6041','Moisturizers','Luminous Dewy Skin Mist','seed_catalog','ACTIVE','Moisturizers','Mists & Essences','35-50','루미너스 듀이 스킨 미스트','40ml','정제수, 글리세린, 스쿠알란, 프로판다이올, 다이메티콘, 트리에칠헥사노인, 폴리글리세릴-2 디이소스테아레이트, PPG-5-세테스-10 포스페이트, 사카로미세스/쌀 발효 여과물, 카멜리아 시넨시스 잎 추출물, 클라도시폰 오카무라누스 추출물, 카멜리아 자포니카 씨 오일, 소듐하이알루로네이트, 세리신, 감초(글리시리자 글라브라) 뿌리 추출물, 쌀(오리자 사티바) 배아 오일, 콘드루스 크리스퍼스 추출물, 인삼(파낙스 진센) 뿌리 추출물, 로열젤리 추출물, 대추(지지푸스 주주바) 열매 추출물, 타임(티무스 세르필룸) 추출물, 스컷텔라리아 바이칼렌시스 뿌리 추출물, 토코페롤, 트라이데세스-12, 소듐라우로일 락틸레이트, 솔비탄 스테아레이트, 에틸헥실글리세린, 베헤닐 알코올, 글리세릴 스테아레이트 SE, 소듐 벤조에이트, 글루코노락톤, 향료, 알코올, 페녹시에탄올, 리모넨, 리날룰','{"what_it_is":"언제 어디서나 촉촉하고 빛나는 피부를 위한 실키하고 미세한 미스트 보습제입니다. 메이크업 전후 모두 사용할 수 있습니다.","suggested_usage":"- 미스트를 부드럽게 흔들고 15cm 거리에서 2~3회 분사하세요.\\n- 메이크업 전 피부 진정과 수분 공급을 위해 사용하거나, 메이크업 후 고정과 매끄럽게 마무리할 때 사용하세요.\\n- 파운데이션 브러시나 스펀지에 뿌려 촉촉한 광채를 연출할 수 있습니다.\\n- 하루 종일 메이크업 위에 뿌려 피부를 재수분하고 활력을 주세요.\\n- 비행기 탑승 시나 겨울철 추가 수분 공급용으로 사용하세요.\\n- 머리카락에 뿌려 아름다운 윤기를 주거나 아이들의 엉킨 머리카락을 풀어주는 용도로도 사용할 수 있습니다.","what_else":"이 제품은 자극 없고 민감하지 않으며, 피부과 테스트를 완료했고 동물 실험을 하지 않았습니다. 미네랄 오일, 합성 향료, 요소, DEA, TEA를 포함하지 않은 포뮬러입니다.\\n\\n아름다움으로 되돌려 드립니다: Tatcha의 정품 스킨케어 제품 구매 시, 브랜드의 Beautiful Faces, Beautiful Futures와 Room to Read의 파트너십을 통해 교육 기회가 필요한 소녀들의 하루 수업을 지원합니다.","concerns_text":null,"highlighted_ingredients":[],"skin_type":null,"ingredient_callouts":null,"brand_story":"300년 넘게 일본 게이샤들은 그들의 지혜와 도자기처럼 맑고 아름다운 피부로 찬사를 받아왔습니다. 수세기 동안 완성된 이들의 미용 비법은 구전으로 세대를 이어 내려온 것으로 알려져 있습니다. TATCHA는 200년 된 고문서에서 이 소중한 일상 관리법을 재발견했습니다. 동양 미인의 아이콘에 경의를 표하며, 과학자, 학자, 그리고 게이샤들과 함께 최고의 녹차, 오키나와 홍조류, 쌀겨를 활용한 독자적인 공정을 개발했습니다. 게이샤의 비밀은 TATCHA에 살아 숨 쉬고 있습니다.","clinical_results":null}','["exclusive"]','특가','https://www.sephora.com/productimages/sku/s1742337-main-zoom.jpg','{"what_it_is":"A silky, fine mist moisturizer that can be used under or over makeup for dewy glowing skin anytime, anywhere.","what_else":"This product is non-irritating, non-sensitizing, dermatologist tested, and cruelty-free. It is also formulated without mineral oil, synthetic fragrances, urea, DEA, or TEA.\\n\\nBeauty that gives back: Your purchase of a full-sized Tatcha skincare item will fund a day of school for incredible girls through the brand’s Beautiful Faces, Beautiful Futures partnership with Room to Read.","suggested_usage":"-Shake the mist gently and spritz two to three times from six inches away.\\n-Use before makeup to soothe and hydrate, or use after makeup to set and smooth.\\n-Can be sprayed on foundation brush or sponge to use with foundation for a dewy glow\\n-Can be used throughout the day on top of makeup to rehydrate and re-energize the complexion\\n-Apply on airplanes or during winter for extra hydration.\\n-Apply on hair for a beautiful sheen or as a detangler for kids.","brand_story":"For over 300 years, Japan’s geisha have been held in awe for their enduring wisdom and breathtakingly beautiful, porcelain skin. Perfected through centuries, it’s widely believed that their beauty secrets were passed down from one generation of geisha to the next by word of mouth alone. TATCHA rediscovered these coveted daily regimes in a 200-year-old manuscript. In homage to these icons of Eastern beauty, a proprietary process was developed with scientists, scholars, and geisha themselves, involving the very best green teas, Okinawa red algae, and rice bran. The secrets of the geisha live on in TATCHA."}','Aqua/Water/Eau, Glycerin, Squalane, Propanediol, Dimethicone, Triethylhexanoin, Polyglyceryl-2 Diisostearate, Ppg-5-Ceteth-10 Phosphate, Saccharomyces/Rice Ferment Filtrate, Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract, Cladosiphon Okamuranus Extract, Camellia Japonica Seed Oil, Sodium Hyaluronate, Sericin, Glycyrrhiza Glabra (Licorice) Root Extract, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Germ Oil, Chondrus Crispus Extract, Panax Ginseng Root Extract, Royal Jelly Extract, Ziziphus Jujuba Fruit Extract, Thymus Serpyllum Extract, Scutellaria Baicalensis Root Extract, Tocopherol, Trideceth-12, Sodium Lauroyl Lactylate, Sorbitan Stearate, Ethylhexylglycerin, Behenyl Alcohol, Glyceryl Stearate Se, Sodium Benzoate, Gluconolactone, Parfum/Fragrance, Alcohol, Phenoxyethanol, Limonene, Linalool','49.0','3.95','2041','209577','105','observed'),
