 dark under-eye circles, bags, puffiness, lines, and wrinkles while brightening and helping eye area appear smoother and firmer.\\n\\nSkin Type: Normal, Dry, Combination, and Oily","concerns_text":"Fine Lines and Wrinkles, Dark Circles, and Puffiness","highlighted_ingredients":["Patented Alguronic Acid: Hydrates and reduces the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.","Triple Algae (Red, Brown, and Green): Help target the look of varying causes and tones of dark circles.","Multi-Peptide Complex: Helps eye area appear firmer and smoother."],"ingredient_callouts":"Free of parabens, formaldehydes, formaldehyde-releasing agents, phthalates, mineral oil, retinyl palmitate, oxybenzone, coal tar, hydroquinone, sulfates SLS & SLES, triclocarban, triclosan, and contains less than one percent synthetic fragrance. It is also vegan.","what_else":"This balm is formulated with alguronic acid, triple algae, and a skin-responsive Multi-Peptide Complex to address the appearance of dark under-eye circles, dark rings, eyelid bags, and puffiness. It leaves the eye area looking brightened, nourished, smoothed, and hydrated.","clinical_results":"In a self-assessment of 27 women participating in a 4-week clinical study, after 10 days of use:\\n- 100% agree that eye area feels moisturized and hydrated\\n- 93% agree under eye dark circles are diminished\\n- 93% agree eye area appears smoother and firmer","suggested_usage":"-Apply to the eye area twice a day. Use only as directed.","brand_story":"It started out as a renewable energy project—and turned into an unexpected antiaging discovery. Algenist comes from a team of biotechnology scientists based in San Francisco."}','Aqua (Water/Eau), Stearic Acid, Isopropyl Isostearate, Dimethicone, Glycerin, Pentylene, Glycol, Glyceryl Stearate SE, Cetearyl Alcohol, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, C12-15 Alkyl Benzoate, Limnanthes Alba (Meadowfoam) Seed Oil, Parachlorella Beijerinckii Exopolysaccharides, Corallina Officinalis Extract, Dunaliella Salina Extract, Undaria Pinnatifida Extract, Dipeptide-2, Palmitoyl Tetrapeptide-7, Palmitoyl Hexapeptide-12, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-5, Sodium Hyaluronate, Caffeine, Coffea Arabica (Coffee) Seed Oil, Tribehenin, Ceramide NG, PEG-10 Phytosterol, Tetrahexyldecyl Ascorbate, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice, Tocopheryl Acetate, Bambusa Vulgaris Leaf/Stem Extract, Pisum Sativum (Pea), Extract, Glucosamine HCl, Leuconostoc/Radish Root Ferment Filtrate, Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract, Cucumis Sativus (Cucumber) Fruit Extract, Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Panthenol, Pantolactone, Caprylyl/Capryl Glucoside, Pfaffia Paniculata Root Extract, Ptychopetalum Olacoides Bark/Stem Extract, Lilium Candidum Flower Extract, Rubus Idaeus (Raspberry) Leaf Extract, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice Powder, Vinyl Dimethicone/Methicone Silsesquioxane Crosspolymer, Phospholipids, Ceteareth-20, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Disodium EDTA, Aminomethyl Propanol, Caprylyl Glycol, Lactic Acid, Ethylhexylglycerin, Hexylene Glycol, Hesperidin Methyl Chalcone, Steareth-20, Citric Acid, Sodium Citrate, Chlorhexidine Digluconate, Phenoxyethanol, Potassium Sorbate, Benzyl Alcohol, Sodium Benzoate.','68.0','4.53','1142','17890','162','observed'),
('P479841','4348','Masks','Floral Recovery Overnight Mask with Squalane','seed_catalog','ACTIVE','Masks','Face Masks','50-80','플로럴 리커버리 오버나이트 마스크 (스쿠알란 함유)','100ml','정제수, 글리세린, 스쿠알란, 동백나무씨오일, 세테아릴알코올, 프로판다이올, 1,2-헥산다이올, 아스코빌글루코사이드, 패션프루트씨오일, 콘플라워꽃수, 벚나무(쓴체리)꽃추출물, 작약뿌리추출물, 토코페릴아세테이트, 토코페롤, 수소화코코-글리세라이드, 세테아릴글루코사이드, 세틸알코올, 스테아릴알코올, 소듐스테아로일글루타메이트, 베타인, 수산화나트륨, 아크릴레이트/C10-30알킬아크릴레이트크로스폴리머, 폴리아크릴레이트크로스폴리머-6, 부틸렌글라이콜, 향료, 소듐하이알루로네이트, 포도당, 클로르페네신, 소듐벤조에이트, 포타슘소르베이트.','{"what_it_is":"민감한 피부의 붉은 기, 고르지 않은 피부 톤, 거친 피부 결을 진정시키는 것이 임상적으로 입증된 항산화 페이스 마스크로, 눈에 띄게 고른 피부 톤을 선사합니다.","suggested_usage":"- 얼굴에 고르게 펴 바르고 하룻밤 동안 그대로 둡니다.\\n- 즉각적인 진정이 필요할 경우 5~10분간 바르고 그대로 둔 후 남은 양을 부드럽게 마사지해 흡수시켜 주세요.","what_else":"피부과 테스트를 거친 이 오버나이트 페이스 마스크는 민감한 피부의 붉은 기 완화에 도움을 주는 플로럴 추출물 블렌드로 만들어졌습니다. 비타민 C와 스쿠알란이 함유되어 피부를 눈에 띄게 밝고 매끄럽게 가꾸며, 피부를 감싸는 듯한 편안한 경험을 선사합니다.\\n이 제품은 Allure 베스트 오브 뷰티 어워드 수상작입니다.","concerns_text":"건조함·칙칙함·고르지 않은 피부결","highlighted_ingredients":["패션플라워 오일과 콘플라워 워터: 진정시키고 눈에 띄는 붉은 기 완화에 도움을 줍니다.- 작약 추출물과 벚꽃 추출물: 피부 톤을 눈에 띄게 고르게 하고 피부결 개선에 도움을 줍니다.- 스쿠알란: 피부를 부드럽고 매끄럽게 하며 균형을 유지하는 데 도움을 줍니다."],"skin_type":"중성, 건성, 복합성, 지성","ingredient_callouts":null,"brand_story":"강력한 천연 성분, 고대 의식, 현대 과학을 결합하여 fresh는 효과와 경험을 모두 갖춘 제품을 만듭니다. 탐구는 혁신을 이끌며, fresh의 창립자들은 전 세계를 여행하며 최고 품질의 천연 성분과 전통 문화를 발굴합니다. 진정한 여정은 과학을 통해 자연의 힘을 활용하고 강화하는 것으로, 효과적이면서도 보기 좋고 향기롭고 기분 좋은 포뮬러를 개발하여 가장 아름다운 피부와 감각을 선사합니다.","clinical_results":"32명의 피험자를 대상으로 4주간 임상 평가 결과:- 53%가 눈에 띄는 붉은 기 감소를 경험했습니다.- 36%가 더 고른 피부 톤을 확인했습니다.- 42%가 더 매끄러운 피부결을 경험했습니다.\\n\\nSephora의 Clean 기준은 파라벤, 황산염, 프탈레이트, 미네랄 오일 등 특정 성분 없이 효과적인 제품을 제공하겠다는 약속입니다. 자세한 내용은 여기에서 확인하세요."}','[]',NULL,'https://www.sephora.com/productimages/sku/s2535417-main-zoom.jpg','{"what_it_is":"An antioxidant face mask that is clinically proven to calm signs of sensitivity—redness, uneven tone, and rough skin—for a visibly even-toned complexion.","skin_type":"Normal, Dry, Combination, and Oily","concerns_text":"Dryness, Dullness, Uneven Texture","highlighted_ingredients":["Passionflower Oil and Cornflower Water: Help to calm, reduce visible redness, and soothe.- Peony Extract and Cherry Blossom Extract: Help to visibly even skin tone and improve skin’s texture.- Squalane: Helps smooth, soften, and keep skin balanced.."],"what_else":"This dermatologist-tested overnight face mask is powered by a blend of floral extracts to calm and reduce the look of redness on sensitive skin. Formulated with vitamin C and squalane to visibly brighten and smooth, this even skin tone product envelops skin with a cocooning experience.\\nThis product is an Allure Best of Beauty award winner.","clinical_results":"In a clinical assessment of 32 subjects over four weeks:- 53% saw a reduction in visible redness.- 36% saw more visibly even-toned skin.- 42% saw smoother-textured skin.\\n\\nClean at Sephora is our commitment to offering effective products without certain ingredients, such as parabens, sulfates, phthalates, and mineral oils. Learn more here.","suggested_usage":"-Apply an even layer on the face and leave on overnight.\\n-For immediate relief, apply and leave on for five to 10 minutes. Gently massage in excess.","brand_story":"By combining potent natural ingredients, ancient rituals, and modern science, fresh creates products that perform with experiences that transform. Discovery drives innovation. fresh’s Founders travel the world uncovering the highest quality natural ingredients and time-honored cultural traditions. But the real journey is using science to harness and heighten nature—developing effective formulas that look, smell, and feel as good as they work—to bring you the most beautiful skin and sensations."}','Aqua (Water), Glycerin, Squalane, Camellia Oleifera Seed Oil, Cetearyl Alcohol, Propanediol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Ascorbyl Glucoside, Passi ora Edulis Seed Oil, Centaurea Cyanus Flower Water, Prunus Cerasus (Bitter Cherry) Flower Extract, Paeonia Suffruticosa Root Extract, Tocopheryl Acetate, Tocopherol, Hydrogenated Coco- Glycerides, Cetearyl Glucoside, Cetyl Alcohol, Stearyl Alcohol, Sodium Stearoyl Glutamate, Betaine, Sodium Hydroxide, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Polyacrylate Crosspolymer-6, Butylene Glycol, Parfum (Fragrance), Sodium Hyaluronate, Glucose, Chlorphenesin, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate.','69.0','4.8','1128','30022','163','observed'),
