('RV-0-250-097594','P411540','SEED_CATALOG','RV-0-250-097594','3',0,'Great idea, decent execution','좋은 아이디어, 괜찮은 실행력','I was very excited to try this product because I have a ruddy complexion that I’m always trying to tone down. It works fairly well, but the texture is a bit thick and pasty. It doesn’t glide on as easily as I’d hoped. I also think I may have gotten some a little too close to my eyes, and it caused some stinging. I like the idea of this product, but I don’t think this is the perfect one for me.','피부가 붉은 편이라 항상 톤을 다운시키려고 해서 이 제품을 써보고 싶었어요. 꽤 효과가 있긴 하는데, 제형이 좀 두껍고 되직해요. 생각만큼 부드럽게 발리진 않더라고요. 눈가에 좀 가까이 발랐나 봐요, 따가움도 있었고요. 제품 아이디어는 좋은데 저한테는 완벽한 제품은 아닌 것 같아요.','normal','light','blonde','blue'),
