('RV-0-250-340440','P461159','SEED_CATALOG','RV-0-250-340440','4',1,'Got it for free but may buy','무료로 받았지만 구매할 수도 있어요','It made my skin feel soft and smooth.  My initial thoughts are it does not go as far as I would like.  You need to use a lot of the serum. I was only given a one week sample to try but I will probably get more to keep using.   After using my 7-day sample,  I did see a difference in my fine lines.  I would use it in the morning and night even thought it says night. @influenster','피부가 부드럽고 매끄럽게 느껴졌어요. 처음에는 양이 좀 적다고 생각했어요. 세럼을 꽤 많이 써야 하더라고요. 1주일 샘플만 받았는데 계속 쓰려고 더 살 것 같아요. 7일 샘플 사용 후 잔주름이 좀 개선된 게 보였어요. 밤용이라고 하지만 아침, 저녁 모두 쓸 거예요. @influenster','combination','light','brown','blue'),
