('RV-0-250-313061','P415771','SEED_CATALOG','RV-0-250-313061','5',1,'IMPRESSED!','감탄했어요!','I am absolutely in love with all their products and has made a huge HUGE difference for my skin. I have been using it for about 3 weeks now in combination with the Violet-C Brightening Serum, and my skin is a lot smoother and softer, more even-toned skin, it looks healthier overall and has made applying makeup SO much easier and BETTER! I use to have bad acne and had spots on my face but I noticed it’s fading away (not sure if this products is suppose to help with it, but I noticed the marks fading! and they’ve been there for months!) And a little drop of the essence goes a long way! I’m impressed with Tatcha products. I’ll definitely be continuing using this. Thank you to Influenster and Tatcha for sending me this complimentary to try!','모든 제품이 너무 좋아서 피부에 엄청난 변화를 줬어요. 바이올렛-C 브라이트닝 세럼과 함께 3주 정도 써봤는데 피부가 훨씬 부드럽고 매끄러워졌고, 톤도 고르게 건강해 보여요. 화장도 훨씬 잘 먹고 좋아졌어요! 예전엔 심한 여드름과 잡티가 있었는데 점점 옅어지는 게 보여요(이 제품이 그런 효과가 있는지는 모르겠지만, 몇 달째 있던 자국이 희미해졌어요!). 에센스 한 방울이면 충분해요! Tatcha 제품에 감탄했어요. 앞으로도 계속 쓸 거예요. 인플루엔스터와 Tatcha에 감사해요, 무료로 써볼 수 있게 해줘서!','combination','light','black','brown'),
('RV-0-250-315544','P415771','SEED_CATALOG','RV-0-250-315544','5',1,'IMPRESSED!','감탄했어요!','I am absolutely in love with all their products and has made a huge HUGE difference for my skin. I have been using it for about 3 weeks now in combination with the Violet-C Brightening Serum, and my skin is a lot smoother and softer, more even-toned skin, it looks healthier overall and has made applying makeup SO much easier and BETTER! I use to have bad acne and had spots on my face but I noticed it’s fading away (not sure if this products is suppose to help with it, but I noticed the marks fading! and they’ve been there for months!) And a little drop of the essence goes a long way! I’m impressed with Tatcha products. I’ll definitely be continuing using this. Thank you to Influenster and Tatcha for sending me this complimentary to try!','모든 제품이 너무 좋아서 피부에 엄청난 변화를 줬어요. 바이올렛-C 브라이트닝 세럼과 함께 3주 정도 써봤는데 피부가 훨씬 부드럽고 매끄러워졌고, 톤도 고르게 건강해 보여요. 화장도 훨씬 잘 먹고 좋아졌어요! 예전엔 심한 여드름과 잡티가 있었는데 점점 옅어지는 게 보여요(이 제품이 그런 효과가 있는지는 모르겠지만, 몇 달째 있던 자국이 희미해졌어요!). 에센스 한 방울이면 충분해요! Tatcha 제품에 감탄했어요. 앞으로도 계속 쓸 거예요. 인플루엔스터와 Tatcha에 감사해요, 무료로 써볼 수 있게 해줘서!','combination','light','black','brown'),
('RV-0-250-311341','P415771','SEED_CATALOG','RV-0-250-311341','5',1,'Refreshing','상쾌해요','I received this product complimentary from Influenster in exchange for my honest review. I will start by saying that this type of product is not something that I typically have had in my every day routine. With that being said - I will be from now on! I’ve been using this product for a few weeks and love it. My skin has been hydrated, plump, smooth and soft. Product smells decent, is affordable, and quick to apply day and night! Also love to use this on my no makeup days when I need a little pick me up. Would purchase again !','인플루엔스터에서 무료로 받아 직접 써본 후기를 남겨요. 이런 종류의 제품은 평소에 잘 쓰지 않았는데, 이제부터는 쓸 것 같아요! 몇 주간 써봤는데 피부가 촉촉하고 탱탱하며 부드러워졌어요. 향도 괜찮고 가격도 합리적이며 아침저녁으로 빠르게 바를 수 있어요! 화장 안 하는 날에 기분 전환용으로도 좋아요. 재구매 의향 있어요!','combination','light','brown','hazel'),
